<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Metro Information.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Metro Information.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson-Humphrey said it initiated coverage of Metro Information Services Inc as a near-term, long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Metro Information, an information technology services company, launched its initial public offering on January 30.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
